\fs20\b Halvard Guard - evaluation build\b0\par
\par
This is a pre-release evaluation build of Halvard Guard. It is provided as is, without warranty of any kind, for testing on machines you own or administer.\par
\par
Halvard Guard places decoy ("tripwire") files in users' Documents folders and runs as a Windows service. If a program changes a decoy file, Halvard Guard suspends that program. Suspending a program can interrupt unsaved work.\par
\par
It is not yet a complete endpoint protection product: it does not replace antivirus or backups, and it cannot restore files after the fact.\par
\par
Replace this text with the final license agreement before distributing the installer to customers.\par
